# Agent state (.omo/) is intentionally tracked, not ignored: AGENTS.md R1.x makes
# it the durable store for plans, boulders, evidence, decisions and notepads.
# It was listed here while 506 of its files were already committed, so the rule
# only hid new files from `git status`. Do not re-add it.

